{"text": "[deadpan] This cancel button cost Adobe seventy-five million.\nBut first... it cost YOU.\n[curious] Rewind to twenty thirteen.\nAdobe announces no new Creative Suite.\nSoftware you bought once becomes a subscription.\nSubscriptions go from eleven percent of revenue... to about ninety-six today.\nHere's the catch: the plan called \"annual, paid monthly.\"\nSounds monthly. It's a one-year commitment.\nQuit in year one, and you owe HALF of what's left.\nThe FTC says it was buried in fine print, or behind tiny hover icons.\nThe DOJ sued in twenty twenty-four, calling canceling an \"obstacle course.\"\nIn twenty twenty-six, Adobe settled. Seventy-five million in penalties, no admission of wrongdoing.\n[whispers] But the unredacted complaint quotes one Adobe executive: the hidden fee is \"a bit like heroin for Adobe.\"\n[serious] Adobe says it wasn't an executive, and the fee is under half a percent of revenue.\n[deadpan] Half a percent. Heroin. Same fee.\n[sarcastic] And the fee? Not banned. Adobe just has to show it, math included, before you sign up.\nThat cancel button? Still has a price tag. Every source is in the pinned comment.", "model": "eleven_v3", "voice": "8Ln42OXYupYsag45MAUy", "alignment": {"characters": ["[", "d", "e", "a", "d", "p", "a", "n", "]", " ", "T", "h", "i", "s", " ", "c", "a", "n", "c", "e", "l", " ", "b", "u", "t", "t", "o", "n", " ", "c", "o", "s", "t", " ", "A", "d", "o", "b", "e", " ", "s", "e", "v", "e", "n", "t", "y", "-", "f", "i", "v", "e", " ", "m", "i", "l", "l", "i", "o", "n", ".", "\n", "B", "u", "t", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", ".", ".", ".", " ", "i", "t", " ", "c", "o", "s", "t", " ", "Y", "O", "U", ".", "\n", "[", "c", "u", "r", "i", "o", "u", "s", "]", " ", "R", "e", "w", "i", "n", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "w", "e", "n", "t", "y", " ", "t", "h", "i", "r", "t", "e", "e", "n", ".", "\n", "A", "d", "o", "b", "e", " ", "a", "n", "n", "o", "u", "n", "c", "e", "s", " ", "n", "o", " ", "n", "e", "w", " ", "C", "r", "e",